   energy gained                                    -0.294089500280  Eh   (the symmetric solution was not the lowest one)
   <S^2> between the two limits is the diagnostic that the determinant is
   really broken-symmetry; the SIGNS are the diagnostic that the
   polarization sits where it was asked to. A run that swapped the two
   centres has the same energy and the same <S^2>, and is a different state.

